# Description

This program generates custom mazes based on user-defined parameters. It supports two types of structures:

- Perfect Maze: A single unique path exists between the entry and exit, with no loops or isolated cells.

- Imperfect Maze: Multiple paths may exist between the entry and exit, allowing for loops. In this project, these mazes do not contain isolated cells.

Generation Constraints
- Easter Egg "42": Displays "42" using empty cells when dimensions allow.

- Integrity: All external walls must be closed (except for entry/exit points).

- Connectivity: No isolated cells are permitted (excluding the "42" easter egg); all cells must be interconnected.

- Interactivity: Users can regenerate the maze, change wall colors, and display the shortest path.

