## Our planning and how it evolved

We started by creating the maze and cell classes to begin generating the maze. 

Once the generation was complete, we focused on displaying the maze and generating the shortest path.

Then we integrated the menu and color change options, as well as error handling.

Finally, we worked on the bonus feature.

## what work well and what could be improve

We could have adjusted the size of the 42 to match the size of the maze so that it would be more visible if the maze is very large.

## Have we use specific tools ? which one ?

We used simple_term_menu to display a menu for selecting options for the maze.
